# Accessibility

- Native elements first; custom widgets follow the ARIA APG pattern (role, name, state, keyboard).
- Visible focus, logical order, focus moved on route change and into/out of dialogs; skip link on pages with nav.
- Targets ≥ 44 px / 44 pt / 48 dp; text to 200%; reduced motion respected; status via live regions.
- Label in name for speech input; alt text for meaningful images, `alt=""` for decorative.
| Enforced by | |
|---|---|
| jsx-a11y lint + axe in e2e (CI) | automatable checks |
| `TEST_PLAN.md` screen-reader script | manual, each release |

## Never
- div/span as buttons
- positive tabindex
- disabling zoom or font scaling
